= N83 spike38 exact original-top degree of regularity

*Run:* `n83-chain-exact-spike38-20261111-r1`
*First computation:* 2026-11-11 02:58 UTC
*Study:* fixed factor-base index-calculus equations, source-bound exact census

== Result

The exact original-individual-top degree of regularity was certified for all 28 frozen cases: Koblitz and general binary families, m=3 through 9, with natural and planted targets. All four cases at each m have the same degree. The values are 111, 194, 277, 360, 443, 526, and 609, respectively. They equal the frozen prediction `83(m-2)+28` at every measured m.

