== Scope and next work

The proved formula's stated scope is the Koblitz/binary chain with m>=3 and the frozen selector hypotheses. This run therefore does not add prime-field or m=2 measurements. It also does not calculate FFD or LFD, rank factor bases, or establish a general solving-time consequence. The native certificate bridge has not yet received a full Lean formalization or independent scientific review.

The next measurement is a separately frozen extension for the remaining families and m values, using the same immutable point bases and an appropriate method for inputs outside this theorem's hypotheses. FFD/LFD labels and grouped model training remain separate downstream work.

